<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Trading was moderately active. Top $58.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs   58.00-58.50</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs   57.50-58.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs   56.50-57.50</p>
<p>  Sows - up $0.50/off $1.00. Top $53.50.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    48.50-50.50</p>
<p>		  500-650 lbs    51.00-53.50</p>
